                            <h3 class="h5 fw-bold mb-2">5 Workshops &amp; Tutorials</h3>
                            <p class="mb-3">Day-long programs on agent skills, agentic software engineering, RL environments, discovery agents, and more.</p>
                            <a href="/pages/workshops/" class="btn btn-outline-primary" style="border-color:var(--cais-accent); color:var(--cais-accent);">
                                <i class="bi bi-arrow-right me-1"></i>Browse Workshops
                            </a>
